@startuml seq_com_comm_control
title SC-COM-03 - Communication control: stop and restart TCU transmission

participant "UDS tester" as Tester
participant "Plant model" as Plant
participant "TCU" as TCU

note over Tester, TCU
Covers: SYS-COM-005, SYS-DIA-002, SYS-DIA-003, SYS-COM-004, SIM-PLT-004, SIM-TST-004
UDS requests on DIAG_PhysReq 0x7E1, responses on DIAG_Resp 0x7E9 (can_matrix section 5).
CAN frames pass can0 / slcand / gateway transparently (DC-05, SIM-GW-001), see SC-STA-04.
end note

note over TCU: control active, default session; the tester runs beside the plant model (SIM-TST-004)
Tester -> TCU : 28 01 01
TCU --> Tester : 7F 28 7F
note right: 28 only in the extended session (reprogramming section 3)
Tester -> TCU : 10 03
TCU --> Tester : 50 03 00 32 01 F4
Tester -> TCU : 28 01 01
TCU --> Tester : 68 01
TCU -> TCU : stop TCU_Actuators and TCU_Status (enableRxAndDisableTx, SYS-COM-005)
note right of TCU: t0 = time of the last TCU_Actuators frame

loop every 10 ms, reception continues (SYS-COM-005)
  Plant -> TCU : SIM_Driver, SIM_Speed, SIM_Analog
end
... 50 ms without TCU_Actuators ...
Plant -> Plant : t0 + 50 ms: hydraulic default SS_A = SS_B = OFF, PCS_Duty = 0 %,\nRLS = OFF, SLS = OFF, FaultLamp = OFF (SIM-PLT-004)

alt restart by the tester
  Tester -> TCU : 28 00 01
  TCU --> Tester : 68 00
  TCU -> TCU : restart transmission (enableRxAndTx, SYS-COM-005)
else tester stops: no request for S3 = 5000 ms
  ... 5000 ms without request ...
  TCU -> TCU : back to the default session, effect of 28 (and 85) undone (SYS-DIA-003)
end
loop TCU transmission running again
  TCU -> Plant : TCU_Actuators every 10 ms, TCU_Status every 100 ms (SYS-COM-004)
end
Plant -> Plant : uses TCU_Actuators again
@enduml
